  "contentHtml": "<p>I thought this was a splendid and highly innovative year.&nbsp; Here is my list, in the order I saw them, noting that a link typically brings you to my review:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/resurrection.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Resurrection</a></p>\n<p>Testament of Ann Lee</p>\n<p>28 Years Later</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/wuthering-heights-the-movie.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Wuthering Heights</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/sirat.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sirat</a></p>\n<p>Project Hail Mary</p>\n<p>A Man on the Run</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/the-drama-no-spoilers.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Drama</a></p>\n<p>The Blue Trail</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/silent-friend.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Silent Friend</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/the-pressure-no-spoilers.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Pressure</a></p>\n<p>Blue Heron</p>\n<p>The Invite</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/07/the-odyssey-the-movie-no-real-spoilers.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Odyssey</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/08/finding-emily.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Finding Emily</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/10/what-ive-been-reading-297.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">You Can See Everything</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/fjord-and-fatherland.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fjord</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/fjord-and-fatherland.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fatherland</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/godzilla-minus-zero-no-spoilers.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Godzilla: Minus Zero</a></p>\n<p>Queen at Sea</p>\n<p>What else?&nbsp; <em>La Bola Negra</em> has good reviews but I have not seen it yet.&nbsp; <em>Confession</em> is receiving raves.&nbsp; Of those listed, <em>Sirat</em> would be my definite favorite, big screen required of course.</p>\n<p>I will give you an update for the rest of the year later in December, noting that anything appearing on Dec.31 in LA and NYC counts as 2027 for me.</p>",
